# Garmr public-export DENYLIST — never copied into the public tree, even if
# tracked. Directory names, path prefixes, and glob patterns. Applied after the
# `git archive` extract and before the allowlist enforcement. Fail-closed: the
# verify step re-checks that none of these survive.
